Package: ZarrSparseMatrix
Type: Package
Title: DelayedArray Backend for Sparse Matrices Stored in Zarr
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person("Gabriel", "Hoffman", role=c("aut", "cre"), email="gabriel.hoffman@mssm.edu", comment=c(ORCID="0000-0002-0957-0224"))
Description: Provides the ZarrSparseMatrix class, a DelayedMatrix backend for
    sparse matrices stored in CSR or CSC layout in a Zarr store as 'data',
    'indices' and 'indptr' arrays (e.g. the X group of an AnnData .zarr
    store). It is the Zarr counterpart of HDF5Array::H5SparseMatrix and reads
    data with Rarr.
URL: https://github.com/GabrielHoffman/ZarrSparseMatrix
BugReports: https://github.com/GabrielHoffman/ZarrSparseMatrix/issues
